## Status Legend

- **Not Started** — Requirement defined but no work begun
- **In Progress** — Active development underway
- **In Review** — Implementation complete, awaiting review
- **Done** — Verified and accepted
- **Blocked** — Cannot proceed (document blocker in Notes)

## Completion Criteria

- [ ] All requirements reach **Done** status
- [ ] `cargo check` passes with no warnings
- [ ] `cargo test` passes
- [ ] Application runs successfully via `cargo tauri dev`
- [ ] Progress tracker archived to `openspec/archive/mvp-1.0/`
